@Kodu24.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5134

### Kõik linnaosad
GET {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/districts
Accept: application/json

### Tundmatu tee -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/olematu

### Registreerimine
POST {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "uus.kasutaja@kodu24.ee",
  "password": "Parool123!",
  "fullName": "Kati Karu",
  "phone": "+3725551234",
  "role": "Seeker"
}

### Sisselogimine (testkonto)
# @name login
POST {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "liis@kodu24.ee",
  "password": "Parool123!"
}

### Sisselogitud kasutaja (token eelmisest päringust)
GET {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Üürileandja sisselogimine
# @name landlord
POST {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mari@kodu24.ee",
  "password": "Parool123!"
}

### Kuulutuste otsing (uuemad ees, 12 leheküljel)
GET {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings

### Otsing filtritega: 2 tuba, 400–900 €, odavamad ees
GET {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings?minPrice=400&maxPrice=900&rooms=2&sort=price_asc

### Otsing linnaosa ja otsingusõnaga, teine lehekülg
GET {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings?district=2&q=korter&page=2&pageSize=5

### Vigane päring: min > max -> 400
GET {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings?minPrice=900&maxPrice=400

### Üks kuulutus
GET {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings/1

### Kuulutuse lisamine
# @name created
POST {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{landlord.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Valoisa kahetoaline Kalamajas",
  "address": "Kotzebue 12-4",
  "districtId": 2,
  "price": 720,
  "rooms": 2,
  "areaM2": 52.5,
  "description": "Renoveeritud korter, rõdu hoovi poole.",
  "latitude": 59.4442,
  "longitude": 24.7339
}

### Kuulutuse muutmine
PUT {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings/{{created.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlord.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Valoisa kahetoaline Kalamajas (hind alla)",
  "address": "Kotzebue 12-4",
  "districtId": 2,
  "price": 690,
  "rooms": 2,
  "areaM2": 52.5,
  "latitude": 59.4442,
  "longitude": 24.7339
}

### Kuulutuse kustutamine
DELETE {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings/{{created.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{landlord.response.body.$.token}}

###
